# Bracket the first occurrence of 101 and stop.
#
#   rw progs/first.rw '00101101'   ->   00[101]101
#
# The right-hand side contains the left-hand side, so as an ordinary rule this
# never stops: it would bracket its own brackets until the tape overflowed.
# The terminal dot is what makes it halt after one rewrite.
101->.[101]
